2026-08-13  Daniel W. McRobb  <dwm@spark.mcplex.net>

	* classes/include/DwmMcCurtainIpv4Net2AS.hh
	* classes/src/DwmMcCurtainIpv4Net2AS.cc
	Add LoadCAIDAV4Routeviews(const CaidaV4Routeviews &) and use
	it to simplify the constructor and
	LoadCAIDAV4Routeviews(const std::string & path).

	* Testing started on kiva.

	* A bunch of changes to use new CaidaV4Routeviews to load CAIDA
	routeviews in a form more amenable to the desired aggrregation.
	Post-aggregation, the contents of a CaidaV4Routeviews can be
	used to create Ipv4Net2AS and AS2Ipv4Net instances.  These are
	new, replacing Ipv4Net2ASDb and AS2Ipv4NetDb.

2026-07-31  Daniel W. McRobb  <dwm@kiva.mcplex.net>

	* tagged as mccurtain-0.0.23

	* apps/mccurtaind/DwmMcCurtainServer.cc:
	Fixed GetASPrefixesResponse().

	* tagged as mccurtain-0.0.22

	* Migrated from Ipv4Routes to Ipv4PrefixPatricia to contain the
	prefix to AS mapping.  The IP to AS lookups are twice as fast, and
	the resident set size for mccurtaind is roughly halved.

